{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "63775fc10b7cf6475210f815bad209035780ce95e44e7678c992defecf48f1b0", "ja": "雑誌のグラビア撮影", "zh": "杂志写真拍摄", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5000_place", "source_sha256": "ad1b9662f0f5caab7017dee2bd6bb0813bbecb1dcf3b9d5e66edb20c29778c1c", "ja": "キッチンスタジオ", "zh": "厨房摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5001_p", "source_sha256": "dd703b7effc762b5fb99b1518b33656d091ccb07c53e149c95c89645628151c3", "ja": "（今日のグラビア撮影のテーマは『お弁当作り』。\n美奈子は料理上手だし、撮れ高が期待できそうだ）", "zh": "（今天的写真拍摄主题是“制作便当”。美奈子很擅长料理，应该能拍出不错的效果。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5002_019min", "source_sha256": "f5ea7186079efeb5d7128f52bbb4f67434324f57613742f2da0615e6c351c0fb", "ja": "わっほーい！　いつもと違う厨房って\nテンション上がっちゃいますね♪", "zh": "哇呼——！在和往常不一样的厨房里，真的让人兴奋起来了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5003_019min", "source_sha256": "f89fadbd0cfb767a227c9d96c8b5d7bee592f0c57e7f7caec2a053ecc1f1fa21", "ja": "しかも、冷蔵庫の食材を全部自由に使って、\n作りたいものを作っていいそうです。わっほーい！", "zh": "而且听说可以随意使用冰箱里的食材，想做什么都可以。哇呼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5004_p", "source_sha256": "ab36701a26beeb211e5b4578d09c41cb4a785bfe9e8c4ca011f1efc74db232d5", "ja": "ああ。美奈子の料理の腕前を見込んで、\nオファーしてくれたんだろうな。", "zh": "啊。看来是看中了美奈子的厨艺，才向她发出邀请的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5005_019min", "source_sha256": "5d9d88439380857f89cd0c5b0f38c1744f0c61e21ef71e397e213937ebca6a4b", "ja": "こうなったら私、すごいお弁当を作っちゃいますよ♪\n食べると元気になれるみたいな！", "zh": "既然这样，我就来做一份超棒的便当吧♪\n就是那种吃了之后就能打起精神的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5006_p", "source_sha256": "77cc411cb0f812242f206c0400c43ae7fa00aea135791e3319e4ad771d4fd5f7", "ja": "それは楽しみだな。ちなみに、\n具体的に何を作るかはもう決まってるのか？", "zh": "那我可就期待了。顺便问一下，具体要做什么，已经决定好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5007_019min", "source_sha256": "4a9ea1469fd4e0a846cb97fb25185a7f0b40dc3eeb188b1def1e79ab4803958d", "ja": "えっと、それは……えへへ。実はまだ迷ってるんです。\nどんなお弁当が食べてみたいとか、ありますか？", "zh": "那个嘛……嘿嘿，其实我还在犹豫呢。\n有没有什么想尝尝看的便当？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5008_p", "source_sha256": "d26be9506fd07ec697df4baca0247edae6612c62e06b6c26d2aefa51835664f7", "ja": "食べてみたいお弁当？　そうだなぁ……。", "zh": "想吃的便当？这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5009", "source_sha256": "42225caf78214fdc04c4e6faecc559863585171f72d0f0fb03a03681b6da39cf", "ja": "ボリューム重視", "zh": "注重份量", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5010", "source_sha256": "9e4acb0b8ce5a19920f59a8cc1cfc2ca8a99fb6efcccb74de883c62f4c8439c1", "ja": "栄養バランス重視", "zh": "注重营养均衡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5200_p", "source_sha256": "72f42c05967640a3fcacc312223f4be71608e6d5afec78028023b9159188cfe3", "ja": "ボリュームのあるお弁当が食べたいな。\nたっぷり栄養を摂れば、午後からも頑張れそうだし。", "zh": "我想吃份量足一点的便当呢。\n摄取充分的营养，下午也能干劲满满。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5201_019min", "source_sha256": "e028d08a81dcd39797511f945585050ae73ac30c26e35a96cafb14f8ea64038d", "ja": "{$P$}さんもそう思いますか？\nやっぱり、ボリュームはすっごく大事ですよね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也这么认为吗？\n果然，分量真的非常重要呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5202_019min", "source_sha256": "2edd32cd9a840f2b9f4ff087cbac190de44d1a56842bf36e829df8c03d6bf08d", "ja": "お弁当箱は、もちろん三段？　……いえ、ここは\n思い切って、六段とか！　腕が鳴ります♪", "zh": "便当盒当然要三层？……不，干脆大胆一点，做成六层吧！我的手都开始痒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5300_p", "source_sha256": "72f42c05967640a3fcacc312223f4be71608e6d5afec78028023b9159188cfe3", "ja": "ボリュームのあるお弁当が食べたいな。\nたっぷり栄養を摂れば、午後からも頑張れそうだし。", "zh": "我想吃份量足一点的便当呢。\n摄取充分的营养，下午也能干劲满满。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5301_019min", "source_sha256": "633ab1f7df51c2529d429247234502fcb74c5547603c5f38688014395f0b7297", "ja": "私もそう思います！　お弁当でも、\nメニュー次第でボリューム感は出せますし。", "zh": "我也这么觉得！便当的话，也可以根据菜单搭配出分量感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5302_019min", "source_sha256": "91cd0cbff1dffcc699834e56371483437902cb5b7b6b9f43cc81bfbfc5badf5f", "ja": "がっつり系のお肉や、揚げ物を中心に……うん。\n{$P$}さん、味見お願いしますね！", "zh": "以分量足的肉类和油炸食品为主……嗯。\n{$P$}先生，麻烦您帮忙尝尝味道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5500_p", "source_sha256": "c33f28e23055c5ee2210ddc955abf4f9eebede3332c38f2e9e8fe113ceeede19", "ja": "栄養バランスに気遣ったお弁当がいいかも。\nついつい偏りがちだし……。", "zh": "便当还是注意一下营养均衡比较好。\n毕竟不知不觉就会吃偏了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5501_019min", "source_sha256": "a7e048b806a0a6a2fff61e2efed17a63c0823ad1ed6c2361ac57bf2401971b81", "ja": "なるほど……それなら、中華弁当はどうでしょう？\nお肉も野菜も、たっぷり食べられますからね！", "zh": "原来如此……那中式便当怎么样？\n肉和蔬菜都能吃得很足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5502_019min", "source_sha256": "8d009fcab03ea602110d4e603e867652800812723357e22c360d6023ee2a612c", "ja": "主食は五目炒飯で、主菜は青椒肉絲、副菜に回鍋肉！\n副副菜は～……うんうん、イメージが湧いてきました♪", "zh": "主食是什锦炒饭，主菜是青椒肉丝，副菜就做回锅肉！\n至于再加一道小菜嘛～……嗯嗯，我已经有画面了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5600_p", "source_sha256": "c33f28e23055c5ee2210ddc955abf4f9eebede3332c38f2e9e8fe113ceeede19", "ja": "栄養バランスに気遣ったお弁当がいいかも。\nついつい偏りがちだし……。", "zh": "便当还是注意一下营养均衡比较好。\n毕竟不知不觉就会吃偏了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5601_019min", "source_sha256": "1f38d511e6a36c6c9e0c2b6db88351110e345846e074832af8e47f45a7c28575", "ja": "確かに！　{$P$}さんみたいな\n人にこそ、体にいい料理を食べてもらわなきゃ……。", "zh": "确实！{$P$}先生这样的人，更应该吃对身体好的料理才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_5602_019min", "source_sha256": "fbc5c41d2d9be4c2f252321c61b8bfa4bcfca788efbe6cb56335ff84e7d81fb8", "ja": "そうだ、お弁当にスープもつけましょう！\n手軽に栄養が摂れますよ♪　おかわり自由で！", "zh": "对了，便当里也加上汤吧！\n这样就能轻松补充营养了哦♪ 还可以免费续碗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
